          <Data name="Description_EN">
            <value><![CDATA[Tadrart Acacus is one of the world's most important rock art sites and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. It contains thousands of prehistoric rock paintings and engravings depicting human life, wildlife, and environmental changes across the Sahara over thousands of years, providing exceptional evidence of prehistoric civilizations.
