          <Data name="Description_EN">
            <value>A small Doric temple at the ancient harbour of Lepcis Magna (Leptis Magna), near Al Khums, Libya. It formed part of the monumental architecture of the harbour and faced the harbour entrance. Archaeological evidence indicates that the small harbour temples belong to the Severan rebuilding programme.</value>
