            <value><![CDATA[South Byzantine Gate is one of the fortified entrances to ancient Sabratha, built during the Byzantine period as part of the city's defensive walls. It represents an important example of late antique military architecture and lies within the UNESCO World Heritage Site.‏‏‏‏‏]]></value>
